[h1]Project Vigilance: Geoscape & Early Warning[/h1]
[b]Replaces instantaneous map-edge teleportation with physical overland transit, dynamic staging, 3-tier Fog of War, early-warning radar networks, unmanned listening posts, seamless camera zoom, and tactical ground interception.[/b]
No high-tech prerequisites. Era-agnostic. Safe to add mid-save.
[hr][/hr]
[h2]Key Features[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]Campaign Creation Wizard & Mutability:[/b] Dedicated setup page between Storyteller and World parameters with 4 presets: [i]Fog of War[/i] (recommended default), [i]Planetary Surveillance[/i], [i]Hardcore Vigilance[/i], and [i]Omniscient[/i]. Includes granular rule customisation, cryptographic HMAC-SHA256 save integrity ledgers, and [i]Blind Touchdown[/i] on uncharted globes.
[*] [b]3-Tier Hierarchical Fog of War:[/b] [i]Shrouded[/i] (unexplored obsidian shroud with atmospheric motion and GPU terrain culling), [i]Haze[/i] (surveyed geography), and [i]Clear[/i] (live sensory coverage). Dynamic camps, quests, and bandit sites stay concealed until scouted (quest timers pause while hidden).
[*] [b]Planetary Radar Grid & Interferometry:[/b] 3D holographic perimeter rings and hexagonal honeycomb overlays on the globe. Adds [i]Lookout Watchtowers[/i] (Neolithic), [i]Early-Warning Radar Domes[/i] (Industrial), [i]Spacer Phased Arrays[/i], and [i]SIGINT Consoles[/i] with power scaling, multi-dish classification stacking, and mountain radar shadows.
[*] [b]Unmanned Listening Posts & Signal Beacons:[/b] Deploy solar listening relays and timber/stone signal beacons from caravans or colony expeditions via intelligent right-click hex menus. Dismantle for 75% material recovery or repair sabotaged posts.
[*] [b]Seamless Geoscape / Battlescape Zoom:[/b] Scroll past maximum map zoom to transition smoothly into the planetary Geoscape centred on your colony, or zoom in past minimum globe altitude to drop straight into an active map.
[*] [b]Real-Time Overland Transit & Ground Interception:[/b] Raids, caravans, visitors, and ambushers march physically across the world map. Intercept hostiles on the hex grid, stalk unaware columns, mount night ambushes, or pursue retreating raiders to rescue kidnapped colonists.
[*] [b]Simulated Inter-Faction Encounters & Aftermath Salvage:[/b] Organic NPC trade caravans travel between settlements; crossing rival forces resolve algebraic skirmishes, spawning persistent aftermath sites with salvageable cargo and wounded survivors.
[*] [b]Night Owl & Schedule-Aware Caravaning:[/b] Caravans respect sleep schedules and Night Owl traits; darkness reduces optical horizons by 50% while Mechanoids and Anomalies march 24/7.
[*] [b]WCAG 2.2 AA Accessibility & Live Scope Preview:[/b] 8 curated themes (including [i]Protanopia / Deuteranopia[/i], [i]Tritanopia[/i], and [i]High Contrast[/i] with automatic faction-colour override disable), [i]Reduce Shroud Motion[/i] toggle, and live CRT radar scope preview.
[/list]
[hr][/hr]
[h2]Modular Suite & Optional Add-Ons[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3847194681]Project Vigilance - Core Framework[/url]:[/b] Recommended shared host for unified Mod Options and multi-module integration.
[*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3847195514]Project Vigilance - Orbital Logistics & Satellites[/url]:[/b] Optional module adding Keplerian drifting satellites, orbital trade hubs, and comms trade passes.
[*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3847195338]Project Vigilance - Aquatic Operations & Sonar[/url]:[/b] Optional module adding coastal hydrophone stations and directional ocean sonar (DevMode preview).
[*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3847195139]Project Vigilance - Thermal Integrity & Materials[/url]:[/b] Optional module preventing unrealistic combustion of solid metals, machinery, radar dishes, and heavy bridges.
[/list]
[hr][/hr]
[h2]Compatibility & Performance[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]DLC Compatibility:[/b] 100% compatible with Base Game, Royalty, Ideology, Biotech, Anomaly, and Odyssey.
[*] [b]Save Games:[/b] Safe to add mid-save with guided adoption dialog. Safe to remove (in-flight incursions disband cleanly).
[*] [b]Performance:[/b] Hierarchical CSR shroud, lazy fine-chunk pre-warming, zero-allocation spatial lookups, and unexplored terrain culling deliver smooth 100+ FPS even on 100% globes.
[/list]
[h2]Recommended Load Order[/h2]
[olist]
[*] Harmony
[*] Core & Official DLCs (all optional)
[*] Project Vigilance - Core Framework
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Geoscape & Early Warning[/b]
[*] Optional Vigilance modules (Orbital, Aquatics, Thermal)
[/olist]
